window.products.push({"id":192220,"name":"Ginpo Pottery Chrysanthemum Rice Earthenware Pot (2 Cups, Cooking, Lapis), Banko Ware Double Lid Earthenware Pot, Rice Cooking, Ginpo Rice Cooker","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":47.71,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71bBrZ5xrES._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"It is a clay pot with excellent functionality and design with the keywords Eco-Lac-Safety characterized by a lid like a chrysanthemum. It becomes double lid specification of the inner lid and the outer lid. Because the water absorption rate is low, you can also cook ingredients that are concerned about odor transfer other than rice. Because it is twice as thick as general earthen pots and can be used to convey heat like wrapping rice, it can easily cook plump, shiny and delicious rice. Open flame, oven and microwave can be used. You can use a microwave for cooking, etc., but you can not cook rice with a microwave. Long diameter 215 × short diameter 195 × height 150 (mm) Capacity: 1.2 L Japanese-made Koto-yaki Yokkaichi, Mie Prefecture","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71bBrZ5xrES._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ginpo touki","source_asin":"B0C2YZQWPJ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-192220","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C2YZQWPJ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C2YZQWPJ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
