window.products.push({"id":192377,"name":"Christmas Net Lights, 12ft x 5ft 360 LED Outdoor Fairy Mesh Lights, 8 Modes Green Wire Connectable Bush Netting Lights for Christmas Trees, Bushes, We","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":25.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/812wnqBl-oL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Net Lights Outdoor & Connectable: 12ft x 5ft mesh lights with 16.4ft lead cable are made of eco-friendly green wire and 30v low power adapter, still safe to touch after long time use and not overheat. End to end connectable/Extendable, connect up to 3 sets. 8 Modes & Memory Function: The Mesh net lights have 8 different Modes: Steady on, Wave, Sequence, Chase, Flash, Flash/Flash, Slow Flash and Slow fade. Build in Memory chip save your last modes setting and no need to reset mode every day. Safe to Use & Easy to Install: UL Listed Plug ensure your safety. Place or hang the outdoor light on trees, bushes, grass or any other outdoor decorations in seconds to finish your decoration. Ideal decorative lights for your diverse need. Waterproof Outdoor Bush Lights- The wires, controller and led lights are IP44 waterproof, it can use outdoor or indoor, so you don't need worry about it when you use the net lights outdoor in any weather. Just keep the adapter away from water. Widely Application & Great After Service : The outdoor net lights is perfect for indoor and outdoor decorations, such as outdoor bushes, trees, fence, Christmas, party, window, festival, holiday, shows, restaurant, hotel, commercial building, shopping center, Xmas decorations etc.12-month friendly customer service for refund/ resend and 24 hours email response.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/812wnqBl-oL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"iShabao","source_asin":"B091YHH6YC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-192377","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B091YHH6YC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B091YHH6YC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":192378,"name":"Republican Presidents \"Grand Ol’ Gang”by Andy Thomas Framed Mini Print","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51ebkaM139L._AC_.jpg","description":"t’s lonely at the top! Our Presidents have a uniquely solitary job. They surround themselves with the strength and wisdom of talented and experienced people, but as Harry Truman once said, “The buck stops here.” We can hardly imagine the weight of decisions they must bear. Perhaps that is why we are so familiar with the before and after photographs depicting the accelerated ageing process while in office. These leaders deserve some time to relax and unwind. Some of the greatest times anyone can enjoy are when we can let our guard down because we are among those who have been where we have been: people who know the truth and don’t make harsh judgments. We can have a great time with each other especially after the challenge has been met and the heat is off. We can talk, commiserate and just be ourselves. Who do former presidents hang out with? Wouldn’t it be just a great time if they could “let their hair down” together and just have a time to laugh and remember? Can you imagine that? Well, here they are: Republicans (Counterclockwise around the table beginning in lower left): GHW Bush, Lincoln, Ford, Nixon, T. Roosevelt, Eisenhower, GW Bush, Reagan","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51ebkaM139L._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"brooklyn-art.com","source_asin":"B00260Z232","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-192378","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00260Z232","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00260Z232","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
