window.products.push({"id":192387,"name":"White 360°Air Purifier for Bedroom, H13 HEPA Portable Air Cleaner with Fragrance Sponge-Aromatherapy, Filter Air/Smoke/Pet, Adaptive 4 Speed Control U","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":39.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71qgOZ4877L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Efficient Purification for Home Office】: The H13 True HEPA Filter work with the Pre-Filter and High-Efficiency Activated Carbon Filter to remove 99.97% of airborne particles 0.3 microns in size, 360° air intake cleans spaces up to 220 ft² helps to enjoy fresh air in minutes. It weighs only 2 pounds but equipped with powerful motor, make it portable for you to Keep the air fresh anytime and anywhere. It is a great gift for babies, pregnant women, newlyweds,pet families. 【Quiet Operation & 8 Timer Options】: Turn on the sleep mode when you're sleeping, working or reading, it will operation ultra quiet, but the purifier is really working, perfect for you to get a comfortable rest. Timer Options (1-8H) allow you set the air purifier to run for a specific time, helping you save energy and money. 【Smart Air Quality Detection & 4 Fan Speed】:Built-in high-precision sensors, real-time monitoring to inform air quality, there are 4 different fan speeds can be selected according to the air quality index on the display. 【Aromatherapy Design】: Add your favorite essential oils (Not Included) to the sponge material (inculded 2 pieces replacement sponge) under the cover, the aroma will diffuse throughout the room with the air movement. You can add any scent you want to get the freshest smell for your room, gentle fragrance helps you relax, focus, energize, and sleep. 【Filter Replacement Indicator】: When the air filter has been used for more than 3000 hours, the indicator light on the top will turn red to remind you that the air filter needs to be replaced. Allowing you and your family to breathe fresh air as if in the depths of the forest. 【Portable Design】: Lightweight and with handle to easily carry, you can put it to anywhere you want, bedroom, bathroom, kitchen, living room, office, car, etc. 【HEPA Replacement】: Please refer to the Asin: B0BZBSM5V7. 【1 Year Warranty】: Intercleaner HEPA air purifiers is a good helper for you to enjoy a healthy life, provide excellent performance at an economical price. Our provides a 1-year warranty and 7 x 24h customer service, no worries about after-sales problems!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71qgOZ4877L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Intercleaner","source_asin":"B09Z7TC9LW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-192387","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09Z7TC9LW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09Z7TC9LW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
