window.products.push({"id":192440,"name":"Record Props - Vinyl Record Display - Combine Vinyl and Album Cover on Wall. Doubles as a Now Playing Tabletop Stand.","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":22.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81k0bVi7DeL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Display vinyl records on a wall or tabletop. Record Props give vinyl listeners the ability to prop albums upright on a tabletop or the option to hang a vinyl record and its album cover on the wall together. All while maintaining the ability to switch out records and continue playing your favorite music, quickly, easily and with no need for frames or shelves.The tabletop display is easy like Sunday morning. Take apart your Record Prop by twisting the center pin counterclockwise, then place the Large X face up on a flat surface the groove facing upward. Grab an album and place it inside the groove.The wall display takes under 10 min to install (and a visual \"how-to\" demo is on our website). Drill a small hole (11/64” or 4.366mm). Insert the included drywall anchor into the wall if needed. Screw the Small X wallmount to the wall. Place the Large X onto the wall mount, insert the pin and twist clockwise to lock. Slide an album cover down against the wall behind the large X and carefully mount a vinyl record on the pin over the protective bumper.You can switch between single albums or thicker gatefolds by removing the pin, rotating the large X 180 degrees and re-securing it the wall in seconds. You can quickly change out vinyl records by carefully grabbing your vinyl record at the edges and turning slightly clockwise as you gently pull outward until it pops off the protective bumper.Record Props have been designed to fit most albums when displaying records on a wall. We've tested countless albums and have come up with a design that fits the overwhelming majority to ensure you can display what is \"now playing\" as often as possible. Box sets, or albums containing three or more vinyl records are an example of those that may not fit. 180 gram two-vinyl albums may not always fit. Single-vinyl albums and most two-vinyl albums with gatefolds will fit. One display per package. Join the #RecordProps community on Instagram","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81k0bVi7DeL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Record Props","source_asin":"B07RZMP76F","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-192440","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07RZMP76F","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07RZMP76F","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
