window.products.push({"id":192583,"name":"Personalized Penguin Ornaments for Christmas Tree – Polyresin Penguin Candy Cane Ornament – Candy Christmas Ornaments – Christmas Penguin Decorations ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":17.94,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71MhcVzDRKL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Premium Quality Candy Cane Tree Ornaments – Unlike other Holiday décor that breaks and falls apart in a matter of weeks. Our penguin Christmas decor is durable and lightweight for lasting quality and easy hanging on the family tree for a special twinkle in your ornament tree décor! Vibrant colors and festive details of a happy penguin holding a giant sparkling red stripes candy cane! This Holiday season, make your home extra merry and bright with these charming Candyland penguin figurines! Expert Artist Personalization – Other personalized penguin Christmas decorations often arrive with messy personalization (or worse, the wrong name). Our talented in-house artists handwrite each personalization to your exact specifications using custom paint pens imported from Germany. Our penguin with candy ornaments are delicately hand painted to ensure a unique appearance for a ONE-OF-A-KIND penguin Holiday ornament, winter tree ornaments and Candyland decorations you'll always cherish! Celebrate life’s biggest moments – and the activities that bring you joy and fulfillment. Every year, you decorate your tree with Christmas ornaments that represent special moments in your life. With our penguin themed Candyland party decorations 2022, expand your collection with the fun ornaments that represent your family’s greatest pleasures. Crafted with festive details and vibrant colors, this adorable resin penguin ornaments will make your tree feel truly special and unique! 24-Hour Order Processing – Our personalized candy cane ornaments make beautiful addition to your Christmas candy cane decorations and whimsical Christmas ornaments set to cherish every season. Your penguin decor will arrive ready for gifting, nestled in tissue paper with a Gift Box, Gift Bag and Gift Tag – no need for wrapping! This fun Christmas ornament will bring some Holiday cheer to your home! The perfect penguin gifts for kids, adults and families that will surely be cherish forever! Happy Families – At Holiday Traditions, we’re dedicated to crafting beautiful candy tree ornaments and winter Christmas decorations for families to celebrate the holidays – and their love for each other. Having been in business for over 17 years, creating and personalizing over 640,000 Christmas ornaments along the way, we’re experts in quality craftsmanship. If for any reason you don’t love your penguins ornaments, please reach out to us directly so we can make it right.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71MhcVzDRKL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Holiday Traditions","source_asin":"B07GC82FHJ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-192583","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07GC82FHJ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07GC82FHJ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
