window.products.push({"id":192616,"name":"Funland Tamagoyaki Pan Nonstcik Japanese Omelette Pan Egg Pan, 7’’x 6’’ Small Square Frying Pan with Silicone Spatula & Brush(Grey), Gray","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":15.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61hfwEDp9bL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"🥘First gourmet—Tamagoyaki Step 1: Beat 3 eggs into a bowl and stir to boil. Step 2: Add a spoonful of white sugar, 1/2 spoon of salt, and 1-2 spoons of milk, stir well and set aside. Step 3: After the omelette pan is evenly heated, use an oil brush to oil the omelette pan. Step 4: Pour half of the egg liquid into the pot, keep it on a medium-low heat, and then use a silicone spatula to fold it a few times and push it to the front. Step 5: Pour the remaining egg liquid into the pot, and turn it over again with a spatula after forming. Step 6: After the Tamagoyaki is boiled out of the pot, cut into small pieces and eat. 🍥Product Features: -Quick heat conduction,help you cook quickly and perfect. -Unique and simple design, acr-shape edge makes omelet slides smoothly into the plate, easy to flip the eggs,sandwiches, pancakes and omelets. -Nonstick coating,easy to clean., PFOA free for healthy cooking. 👉Product Specification: Measures Size: 6\" W x 1.4\" H x 7\" L (15x 3.5 x 18 cm) handle length: 6.5\" (17cm) Weight:1.10lb（0.5kg） Material: Aluminum alloy, wood, stainless steel. Color:Pink / Grey. 👉Package Include: 1×Tamagoyaki pan 1×oil brush 1×silicone spatula. 🚩Tips: (1)Please use sponge or soft cloth to clean. (2)It’s better to use silicone or wooden shovel. Shovel or stainless steel shovel is forbidden. (3)Please pay attention to safety when cooking food, please remember to turn off the heat after cooking.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61hfwEDp9bL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Funland","source_asin":"B09K7DF982","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-192616","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09K7DF982","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09K7DF982","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
