window.products.push({"id":192719,"name":"Novelty Coffee Mugs For Men - 16oz Mug for Coffee,Latte,Cappuccino,Tea,Coffee mug With Metallic Texture,Unique Rust-colored Ceramic Mug 1Pcs","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/617mwv89iaL._AC_SL1100_.jpg","description":"This is a unique, highly personal coffee mug. It looks like a rusty piece of iron, but in fact, it is a ceramic mug using the electro-optical metallic glaze technology. After eight hours of baking at a temperature of 1380 degrees Celsius, The natural blow points and color changes are formed naturally based on some objective factors such as different heating levels, heating angles and other aspects of each mug. Shows different blow points, angles, and color changes. The mug’s interior is completely smooth and round, while its exterior is finished by pinched veins, so that no matter which angle you hold the mug from, your fingers can sink deep into the mug and feel the temperature of the coffee or tea inside. The mug is sturdy and durable. It’s made of premium ceramics without any lead or cadmium. It’s suitable for both hot and cold drinks. The mug’s size features a capacity of 450ML (16OZ), which can meet your needs in the office and at home. This mug is an absolutely exceptional gift: it’s great whether for bosses, colleagues and friends, or for wives, husbands, mothers, fathers, grandmothers, grandfathers, children, and others. The mug is safe inside a microwave oven or a dishwasher. Feel free to let us know if you have any issues! We will spare no effort to solve any issues. Your satisfaction is the objective we pursue!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/617mwv89iaL._AC_SL1100_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"DSKCHAT","source_asin":"B08VDPDB2N","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-192719","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08VDPDB2N","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08VDPDB2N","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":192720,"name":"Iittala Essence 7-Ounce Champagne Glass, Set of 2","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":54.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61dy1VxrVGS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Product Description The set of two champagne glasses from iittala exemplifies finnish design. The essence stemware collection consist of 4 essential pieces, including this 7-ounce champagne glass. According to the designer, alfredo haberli, the thinking behind the design collection was to have as few pieces as possible while still being able to serve a full range of wines/champagnes. Each glass is firmly balanced and feels comfortable in hand. The bowl diameter at the top is 1-3/4- inch. The bowl is 4-inch top to bottom and then 9-inch tall including the stem. Dishwasher safe. Made in Denmark. Amazon.com Combining a minimalist approach with skillful design, Alfredo Haberli's Essence stemware is both sophisticated and remarkably versatile. The modern-meets-traditional shapes feature distinct angular bowls and flat bases in sizes that can be suited to accommodate many beverage choices. This set of two 7-ounce champagne glasses stands 9 inches tall-the same height as the other stemmed glasses-with a long, elegant silhouette that looks equally at home in a formal or casual setting. Whether serving Extra Brut or Doux bubbly, the glasses are sure to be busy entertainers in the household. They are dishwasher-safe and made in Finland. Introduced in 2001, the Essence design has won several prestigious European design awards. --Kara Karll","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61dy1VxrVGS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Iittala","source_asin":"B000KMF7ZQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-192720","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B000KMF7ZQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B000KMF7ZQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
