window.products.push({"id":192754,"name":"Herbs: Camphor Blocks","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":6.75,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/513aFgvK7mL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The waxy white blocks of camphor are perhaps best known for the pungent aroma that they possess. In ancient and medieval Europe and china it was even used as a flavoring agent for sweets as well as many Arabic dishes of the mid ages. Indeed, you can still find sweets flavored with camphor throughout Asia. Today camphor is still found in many over the counter products. In magick, Camphor is ruled by the Moon and water. It is generally use to reduce sexual desire and ward off sickness (particularly the cold and the flu). It is also a strong divinatory herb - if you plan to burn this on charcoal, use a VERY SMALL amount and make sure the room is WELL VENTILATED! Keywords: Chastity, Health, Divination For educational purposes only This information has not been evaluated by the Food and Drug Administration. This information is not intended to diagnose, treat, cure, or prevent any disease.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/513aFgvK7mL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Raven Moon Emporium","source_asin":"B00I1THFZ0","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-192754","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00I1THFZ0","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00I1THFZ0","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
