window.products.push({"id":192884,"name":"18\" Cocktail Mixing Glass Bar Spoon - Long Handle Stainless Steel Drink Pitcher Mixer to Chill and Mix Stirred Drinks - 1 Spoon","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":9.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71GC2jzPb1L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The industry's finest cocktail mixing glass and bar spoon used around the globe by some of the best bartenders in the world. Dilution of drinks like a manhattan or old fashioned is the surest way to decrease the quality of your drink. That's why, in a spirit or liquor forward drink, stirring a cocktail is the best way to preserve the flavor of that delicious bourbon or whiskey you're showcasing and measured out perfectly in your jigger. Leave the shaker set to those who like their drinks watered down. A viciously fast stir is best to chill cocktails without dilution. And for that fast stir, leverage is key. Our long barspoon helps you do just that. That's why we made a long bar spoon for you to mix well with. We (obviously) recommend use with any of our Mixologists or Amehla cocktail mixing glasses. But, respect to that workhorse Japanese yarai that you found at Goodwill. While beloved by cocktail enthusiasts, this spoon can stir mimosas, iced tea, or as coffee bar accessories. Use the back, flat-end as a swizzle stick or muddler in a pinch. But not intended for use as muddler due to thin, flat shape. The Bar Spoon of Barspoons, cocktailery tools aren't all created equal. Your bar accessories effect your drinks - so choose wisely - We promise a quality product and if you're not happy we'll replace or refund you. Stir away friends.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71GC2jzPb1L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Mixologists","source_asin":"B07VVMSSG3","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-192884","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07VVMSSG3","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07VVMSSG3","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
